  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "A transmitting antenna at top of a tower has a height of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>50</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>, and the height of receiving antenna is,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>80</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>. What is the range of communication for the line of sight (LOS) mode?<br />[use radius of the earth<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>6400</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>km</mi><mo>]</mo></math>",
    "image": null
  },
